      "text": "他就对实现了对实践的去控电话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 74,
      "start_ms": 224100,
      "end_ms": 225570,
      "text": "就大家知道它是个镜像"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 75,
      "start_ms": 230960,
      "end_ms": 232000,
      "text": "这很重要"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 76,
      "start_ms": 232000,
      "end_ms": 232930,
      "text": "这很重要"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 77,
      "start_ms": 232930,
      "end_ms": 233860,
      "text": "破除这个东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 78,
      "start_ms": 233860,
